  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Ralph Winter is a German property entrepreneur based in Miami who founded Corestate Capital after leading real estate investments for Cerberus in Germany. He built and held a controlling stake in Corestate before selling his shares. Through his family office, W5 Group, he invests in residential property across Europe and the United States.",
    "html": "<p>Ralph Winter is a German property entrepreneur based in Miami who founded Corestate Capital after leading real estate investments for Cerberus in Germany. He built and held a controlling stake in Corestate before selling his shares. Through his family office, W5 Group, he invests in residential property across Europe and the United States.</p>\r\n",
