  "long_biography": {
    "plain_text": "Ralph Winter’s residential investments place shared spaces alongside private apartments. His American projects incorporated coworking areas, fitness facilities and community programmes designed to connect residents. His plans for an Orlando development combined these facilities with childcare and pet care, while flexible rental arrangements formed part of the broader approach to accommodating changing lifestyles.\n\nHe also served on the board of Best Buddies International, which works with people with intellectual and developmental disabilities. Its leadership programmes teach participants to speak publicly and advocate for themselves. Speech coaches help them organise and practise their accounts, and staff arrange opportunities to address businesses, community groups and legislators.",
    "html": "<p>Ralph Winter’s residential investments place shared spaces alongside private apartments. His American projects incorporated coworking areas, fitness facilities and community programmes designed to connect residents. His plans for an Orlando development combined these facilities with childcare and pet care, while flexible rental arrangements formed part of the broader approach to accommodating changing lifestyles.</p>\r\n<p>He also served on the board of Best Buddies International, which works with people with intellectual and developmental disabilities. Its leadership programmes teach participants to speak publicly and advocate for themselves. Speech coaches help them organise and practise their accounts, and staff arrange opportunities to address businesses, community groups and legislators.</p>\r\n",
